  "interpretation": "QQP is a graph, not a list of independent pairs. Under plain StratifiedKFold a large share of validation questions have already been seen during training in another pair, so validation F1 partly measures memorisation of individual questions. StratifiedGroupKFold over connected components removes that channel; every headline number in this study is reported under both schemes so the size of the effect is visible."
